OL,3,GNEWSAMore winter rain, more potholes,
OL,4,Aroad crews warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FGritting crews have warned that
OL,7,Fincreasingly extreme weather is making
OL,8,Fit harder to keep roads in good
OL,9,Fcondition, as councils prepare for
OL,10,Fanother winter of freezing temperatures
OL,11,Fand heavy rain.
OL,13,F"It's fair to say we're seeing more
OL,14,Fextremes of weather happening now,"
OL,15,Fsaid Ed Bradford, major contracts
OL,16,Fprogramme director at Herefordshire
OL,17,FCouncil.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
