OL,3,GNEWSAMore winter rain, more potholes,
OL,4,Aroad crews warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighways managers in Herefordshire and
OL,7,FWorcestershire said wetter winters were
OL,8,Fputting growing pressure on road
OL,9,Fnetworks, with prolonged rainfall and
OL,10,Fcold snaps increasing the risk of
OL,11,Fpotholes and other damage.
OL,13,FBradford said this year's conditions
OL,14,Fhad highlighted the challenge facing
OL,15,Fcouncils.
